OL,3,GNEWSA'Whirlwind' cancer care as trust
OL,4,Aleaps rankings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cancer patient has said the speed of
OL,7,Fhis diagnosis was like a "whirlwind" at
OL,8,Fa hospital trust previously ranked the
OL,9,Fworst in the country for identifying
OL,10,Fthe disease.
OL,12,FIn February 2025, Shrewsbury and
OL,13,FTelford Hospital NHS Trust (SaTH) was
OL,14,Franked last out of 119 trusts for
OL,15,Fdiagnosing or ruling out cancer.
OL,17,FIt is now the fifth best in the
OL,18,Fcountry, with 87.8% of suspected cancer
OL,19,Freferrals receiving opinions within 28
OL,20,Fdays.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
